OL,3,CFire causes serious damage to The Full
OL,4,CMonty working men's club
OL,6,FA large fire has badly damaged a
OL,7,Fformer working men's club in
OL,8,FSheffield, which was made famous by
OL,9,Fthe film The Full Monty.
OL,11,FFirefighters were sent to the blaze at
OL,12,Fthe derelict building, formerly known
OL,13,Fas Shiregreen Working Men's Club, on
OL,14,FSunday evening.
OL,16,FAt its height, eight fire engines from
OL,17,FSouth Yorkshire Fire and Rescue were
OL,18,Fat the fire on Shiregreen Lane in
OL,19,FSheffield.
