OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F332A1786357092
OL,3,CFire causes serious damage to The Full
OL,4,CMonty working men's club
OL,6,FThe venue was well-known as the
OL,7,Flocation used for the finale of the
OL,8,F1997 comedy The Full Monty, where a
OL,9,Fgroup of unemployed steelworkers get
OL,10,Finvolved in the stripping business to
OL,11,Fearn a living.
OL,13,FThe production company behind the hit
OL,14,Ffilm visited decided on the Shiregreen
OL,15,Fvenue for its older look and character.
OL,17,FThe pub had since closed and the
OL,18,Fbuilding fallen into disrepair,
OL,19,Fdespite a campaign to try and save it.
